<mxCell id="c171" value="FK* on users.id references the tenant DB's own Laravel users table (created by the base migration, not by this module — see AIINSIGHT_SPECS.sql header note). Dashed edges = nullable / informational references (ad hoc queries with no conversation, unannotated last-editor). AIInsight has zero compile-time dependency on any other module's schema — the LEGAL.cases / CRM.leads / ACCOUNTING.gl_journals examples in schema_annotations seed data are plain-text rows, not foreign keys." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5563;align=left;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="800" width="1000" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
